<!--
    Notification small icon for an active dictation session: the White Noise
    mark with exactly the same path as ic_stat_whitenoise, so the logo has the
    same size and position as the message icon in the status bar, plus a
    microphone in the bottom-right corner within the same 52-unit margin. The
    clip path cuts the gap around the microphone, and the corner of the mark
    beside it, out of the mark; its outer square and inner outline wind in
    opposite directions so the nonzero clip excludes the outline. Must stay
    alpha-only white: the system tints small icons itself.
-->
